{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEP INTO RED SKY: A DECENTRALIZED GALAXY BUILT FOR DISCOVERY AND CONNECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Sky</strong> invites you into a living, decentralized galaxy powered by Bluesky\u2019s AT Protocol. Here, every verified user owns and shapes a procedurally generated planet, forming a vast, immersive social universe. Explore billions of star systems, build AI civilizations, and leave your mark on an ever-evolving digital cosmos where every action has lasting impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/extras/e78a0da43fcd6925f1235d7184a3400f.poster.avif?t=1754933718\" width=1600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/extras/e78a0da43fcd6925f1235d7184a3400f.webm?t=1754933718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/extras/e78a0da43fcd6925f1235d7184a3400f.mp4?t=1754933718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE, CLAIM, AND SHAPE YOUR WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Red Sky, planets aren\u2019t just places\u2014they\u2019re <strong>extensions of your identity</strong>. Connect your Bluesky account, scout the stars, and claim a world that resonates with you. Customize its terrain, flora, skies, and even the societies that grow within. Shape your planet into a personal sanctuary, a social hub, or a thriving civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/extras/1e6a466956cf14c62fa8373e413dc256.avif?t=1754933718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/extras_big/1e6a466956cf14c62fa8373e413dc256.avif?t=1754933718 width=1600 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE SOCIAL COMMUNICATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ditch chatboxes\u2014<strong>speak through space itself</strong>. Use planetary communication towers to broadcast thoughts, Bluesky posts, and real-time updates across star systems. Red Sky introduces <strong>spatial communication</strong>, creating a more natural, ambient way to connect across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/extras/b694046696d6d1c6ab3a026bb396659a.avif?t=1754933718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/extras_big/b694046696d6d1c6ab3a026bb396659a.avif?t=1754933718 width=1600 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD AI-POWERED LIFE AND TECHNOLOGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your world to life with <strong>AI companions, robots, and self-evolving systems</strong>. Design sentient machines, build settlements, and create interactive experiences for your visitors. Watch as autonomous AI civilizations evolve with or without your intervention, forging alliances\u2014or rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/extras/a48a1cb5e7df8bfeb6b4ecadb78ecfd5.avif?t=1754933718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/extras_big/a48a1cb5e7df8bfeb6b4ecadb78ecfd5.avif?t=1754933718 width=1600 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEAVE A LASTING IMPRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every traveler is a storyteller. Leave behind <strong>message capsules</strong>, create <strong>planetary embassies</strong>, or establish <strong>interstellar communities</strong>. Visitors can explore your world, uncover your history, and contribute to its ongoing story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/extras/e7b5d19fdc3edbff243db978e24670c8.avif?t=1754933718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/extras_big/e7b5d19fdc3edbff243db978e24670c8.avif?t=1754933718 width=1600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With billions of planets to discover and shape, your journey is never over. Create a unique identity, form a federation, challenge AI empires, and leave behind a legacy that lives on long after you log off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Red Sky.</strong><br>A new kind of social universe\u2014governed by users, powered by AI, shaped by you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918450?t=1754933718","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918450?t=1754933718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/9b3fdb344e0875094cb3fac820136f46d6d85991/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754933718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918450/9b3fdb344e0875094cb3fac820136f46d6d85991/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754933718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEP INTO RED SKY: A DECENTRALIZED GALAXY BUILT FOR DISCOVERY AND CONNECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Sky</strong> invites you into a living, decentralized galaxy powered by Bluesky\u2019s AT Protocol. Here, every 